silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_2_B_olog#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode2 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode2 is the schema-node B of the olog category, concretely the typed box DomesticCat in the Mittens vet-record olog. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'B_olog', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
